<gpx version="1.1" creator="TerraTrack" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<wpt lat="38.994017" lon="-105.056832"><name>Coffee: Woodland Park</name><desc>Mile 0. Cafe Leo, 320 W Midland, 6 to 6, 719-687-6670; Grandmother's Kitchen, 212 US 24, Tue-Sun 6 to 2. Map data.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.992731" lon="-105.056672"><name>Fuel: Woodland Park</name><desc>Mile 0.1. Again at Divide, 6.5.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.945966" lon="-105.289394"><name>Fuel: Florissant, left onto US 24</name><desc>Mile 17.7. The Costello coffee house may have closed for good.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.977093" lon="-105.354517"><name>Coffee: Lake George</name><desc>Mile 22. Gold Water Cafe, 38283 US 24, 6 to 4, closed Mon (listing).</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.994726" lon="-105.368742"><name>Way out: Right onto Tarryall Road</name><desc>Mile 23.5. Short of time? US 24 to Hartsel, 25 mi, paved.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.377450" lon="-105.800365"><name>Check: Left onto US 285, Jefferson</name><desc>Mile 64.8. Jefferson Market: fuel not confirmed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.315586" lon="-105.881932"><name>Way out: Left onto Elkhorn Road</name><desc>Mile 71. Wet? US 285 and CO 9 by Fairplay (fuel) to Hartsel, 28 mi, paved.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.021186" lon="-105.797561"><name>Fuel: Hartsel</name><desc>Mile 99.2. Small; not confirmed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.812245" lon="-106.107322"><name>Fuel: Johnson Village</name><desc>Mile 125.4. CR 313 into Buena Vista.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.841353" lon="-106.129497"><name>Fuel: Buena Vista. LAST SURE FUEL FOR 83 MILES</name><desc>Mile 128.1. Taylor Park Trading Post has a pump on the map; its season is about mid-May to September or October, and fuel wasn't confirmed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.842735" lon="-106.129398"><name>Lunch: Buena Vista</name><desc>Mile 128.3. House Rock Kitchen, 421 E Main, from 11, 719-966-2326; Eddyline, 102 Linderman (listings disagree). Coffee: The Long Table, 302 E Main, from 8; Brown Dog, 713 US 24, 6:30 to 6.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.828067" lon="-106.176675"><name>Way out: Right onto CR 306, Cottonwood Pass</name><desc>Mile 148.3. Closed? Monarch Pass: 112 mi to Crested Butte.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.817884" lon="-106.561535"><name>Check: Taylor Park Trading Post</name><desc>Mile 179.5. Fuel and food in season; not confirmed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.718156" lon="-106.791167"><name>Way out: Right onto Jacks Cabin Cutoff</name><desc>Mile 196.5. Wet? Stay on the river to Almont, CO 135: 23 mi, paved.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.867940" lon="-106.980975"><name>Fuel: Crested Butte</name><desc>Mile 212.3.</desc></wpt>
